    {
      "id": "19:01a44fcb36664ffcad48a30c6f952864@thread.v2",
      "topic": "L3 Plant Standards",
      "plant": "L3",
      "web_url": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/chat/19%3A01a44fcb36664ffcad48a30c6f952864%40thread.v2/0?tenantId=46913ced-e190-4f33-b3f3-2a38ddf9cac4",
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "1790468564803",
          "from": "Chad Stone",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-09-27T00:22:44.803Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-09-26T18:22:44-06:00",
          "text": "Good afternoon Benjamin Hicks\n\nDo you have a double pickup for Monday from republic?",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1790468649458",
          "from": "Benjamin Hicks",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-09-27T00:24:09.458Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-09-26T18:24:09-06:00",
          "text": "Yes, we are scheduled to have double pickups every day next week.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1790487907434",
          "from": "Phillip Perez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-09-27T05:45:07.434Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-09-26T23:45:07-06:00",
          "text": "Safety meeting went well, we talked about being cautious of their surroundings, open doors and disassembled equipment. We will be working with water so watch for slIp hazards. Make sure to lock-out tag-out the machines. And clearance of people from  belt area  before running belts.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "19:5cac812b7b014d96993a8d78de0dd6f4@thread.v2",
      "topic": "L1 Sollich 4 Information Exchange",
      "plant": "L1",
      "web_url": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/chat/19%3A5cac812b7b014d96993a8d78de0dd6f4%40thread.v2/0?tenantId=46913ced-e190-4f33-b3f3-2a38ddf9cac4",
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "1790445249804",
          "from": "Katya Farnsworth",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-09-26T17:54:09.804Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-09-26T11:54:09-06:00",
          "text": "As I walked S4, I koticed that the Conbar was not cleaned at all. Also, tools that were taken were not signed for and left in the area Luis Falcon please follow up",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1790449799137",
          "from": "Curt Willis",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-09-26T19:09:59.137Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-09-26T13:09:59-06:00",
          "text": "Conner Boyd was this 2nd shift?\n\nThank you Katya Farnsworth for the follow up",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1790458001412",
          "from": "Conner Boyd",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-09-26T21:26:41.412Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-09-26T15:26:41-06:00",
          "text": "Yeah in the cleaning paperwork we signed only for the kitchen. \n\nAlso, in the follow-up actions I had a note saying kitchen complete, rest of line still needed Level 2. \nCurt Willis\n\nOnce we have some areas passed on S2, we’ll put our best efforts into getting a pair of EEs over there to clean it.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1790483144080",
          "from": "Conner Boyd",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-09-27T04:25:44.08Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-09-26T22:25:44-06:00",
          "text": "Conbar has been cleaned, we just need it to be tested. \nThough we only have 1 QA and they are very busy at the moment. \nCurt Willis Brandon Hernandez Ebrima Dibba Alfonsina Gil",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1790514144251",
          "from": "Brandon Hernandez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-09-27T13:02:24.251Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-09-27T07:02:24-06:00",
          "text": "Everything is off ot in nigth mode",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
